{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally Gets a Job at a Magazine"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "I'd Like Some Tacos"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about methods of communication and communication technology in common social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le16ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking for Clarification"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "If you don't understand what a person is saying, it is important to ask for clarification in a polite way.<br/><br/>Here are some expressions you can use to ask for clarification:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">I didn't quite hear what you said.</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic\">Can you repeat what you said please?</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic\">What do you mean by ... ?</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic\">Could you be more specific please?</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic\">Would you elaborate on that please?</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic\">Could you give me an example?</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mia</span>: I want a vegetarian dish please.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: I didn't quite hear that. Can you repeat what you said, please?<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Mia</span>: I would like a vegetarian dish.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Would you like a drink from the menu?<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Mia</span>: Could give me example of some drinks?<br/>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "crab cake "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a patty made from crab meat that is fried "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll have the crab cakes please."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when ordering food at a restaurant."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sweet potato fry"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a long thin piece of sweet potato that is cooked in oil "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I get an order of sweet potato fries please?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dipping sauce"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a mixture that you can dip food into before you eat it"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Which dipping sauce would you like with your fries? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ketchup"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a thick cold red sauce made from tomatoes\t "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love to dip my fries in ketchup."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chipotle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a flavour that comes from a hot chili pepper  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have a chipotle flavoured sauce."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mayo"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "short for mayonnaise; a white sauce, made of egg yolks and oil  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I get some extra mayo?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "aioli"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " mayonnaise seasoned with garlic and other spices "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We offer a garlic aioli. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "honey"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a sweet sticky substance produced by bees, used as food "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't like honey. It's too sticky!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cayenne"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a red powder made from a hot pepper \t "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Does the sauce include cayenne?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob10aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet. Find a video about how to make a specific dish."}, {"type": "text", "content": "As you watch the video, write down any questions you have about  it. What are you not sure about? What would you like more information about?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down 5 questions that ask for clarification about things you saw in the video."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose one of your questions. Go on the internet and see if you find an answer to that question. If you can't, try another question."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your questions and an answer with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I watch a video on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write questions that ask for clarification."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I do research about food."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about food with a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "a